{
 "thread": "yQww_gHxKDI",
 "subject": "Functions to make it easier to distribute Shiny code examples",
 "messages_listed": 1,
 "last_activity": "2013-02-21T17:23:22Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "Dzsszd-mZyEJ",
   "from": "Winston Chang",
   "author": "d34d025a513c07fc",
   "date": "2013-02-21T17:23:22Z",
   "subject": "Functions to make it easier to distribute Shiny code examples",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:15px;margin-left:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin-top:0px!important\">\r\n\r\n(The contents of this message are also at: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/wch/5006372\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/wch/5006372&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409769679000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04qEjZM4QnM42HpreJ-Cjg\">https://gist.github.com/wch/5006372</a>)</p><p style=\"margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:15px;margin-left:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin-top:0px!important\">\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:15px;margin-left:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-top:0px!important\">Hi everyone -</p><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">This mailing list is great for communicating ideas and problems, but when it comes to sharing code examples, it can be a bit tedious for app authors to cut and paste their files into an email message, and it can be even more tedious for readers to re-create the files from the email message.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">I&#39;ve written a set of functions that makes this easier:</p><ul style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 30px;border:0px\"><li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">\r\n\r\n<code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">shinySerialize()</code> turns your Shiny app into text that can be cut-and-pasted into an email message.</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">shinyDeserialize()</code> does the reverse: it turns that text into a set of files, in an application directory (and subdirectories, if needed).</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">shinyRun()</code> is a wrapper function that first calls <code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">shinyDeserialize()</code> to write out the app, then calls <code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">runApp()</code> to run it.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">These functions aren&#39;t part of the Shiny package; for now they&#39;re just things I&#39;ve been playing with. They&#39;re defined here:<br><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(65,131,196);text-decoration:initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409769679000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2STf4n4aoIebkeywyx2J-7\">https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">You can load these functions by simply sourcing the file at this URL, using the downloader package:</p><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><pre style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:15px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);line-height:19px;overflow:auto;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\">\r\n\r\ninstall.packages<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;downloader&#39;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\"># Load the functions</span>\r\ndownloader<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">::</span>source_url<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044/raw/aa4dbbca0023e29a629386b1ee9a5d27b2e37362/shinyserialize.r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044/raw/aa4dbbca0023e29a629386b1ee9a5d27b2e37362/shinyserialize.r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409769679000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fblLNsnmAu2HDcT4sQ8Gy\">https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044/raw/aa4dbbca0023e29a629386b1ee9a5d27b2e37362/shinyserialize.r</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n</pre></div><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">Once you&#39;ve done that, the functions will be available for you to use.</p><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">To convert a Shiny app to a format that can be easily copied and pasted, run:</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><pre style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:15px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);line-height:19px;overflow:auto;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\">\r\n\r\nshinySerialize<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;myapp_dir/&#39;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n</pre></div><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">It will output something like this, which you can copy and paste into an email, and other can copy and paste to run (after sourcing the URL above):</p><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:15px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);line-height:19px;overflow:auto;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\">\r\n\r\nshinyRun<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#--------------------------------------------------------------</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">`server.R`</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> quote<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">({</span>\r\nshinyServer<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>input<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> output<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">{</span>\r\n    output<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">$</span>distPlot <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> reactivePlot<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">()</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">{</span>\r\n        dist <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> rnorm<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>input<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">$</span>obs<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n        hist<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>dist<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n    <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">})</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">})</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">}),</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#--------------------------------------------------------------</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">`ui.R`</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> quote<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">({</span>\r\nshinyUI<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>pageWithSidebar<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>\r\n  headerPanel<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Hello Shiny!&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">),</span> \r\n  sidebarPanel<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>sliderInput<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;obs&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> \r\n    <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Number of observations:&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> min <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">0</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> max <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1000</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> value <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">500</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)),</span> \r\n    mainPanel<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>plotOutput<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;distPlot&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">})</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n</pre></div><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">When you distribute your code in this format, put the call to <code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">source_url()</code> at the top, then put the call to <code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">shinyRun()</code> after that. So if you send an email to the list with a simple example, you&#39;d do something like this:</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><pre style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:15px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);line-height:19px;overflow:auto;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\">\r\n\r\ndownloader<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">::</span>source_url<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044/raw/aa4dbbca0023e29a629386b1ee9a5d27b2e37362/shinyserialize.r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044/raw/aa4dbbca0023e29a629386b1ee9a5d27b2e37362/shinyserialize.r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409769679000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fblLNsnmAu2HDcT4sQ8Gy\">https://gist.github.com/wch/5003044/raw/aa4dbbca0023e29a629386b1ee9a5d27b2e37362/shinyserialize.r</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span>\r\n  sha<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;62bbd827ac073e9ad41dacb1e498b64b5c4659df&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n\r\nshinyRun<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#--------------------------------------------------------------</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">`server.R`</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> quote<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">({</span>\r\nshinyServer<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>input<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> output<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">{</span>\r\n    output<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">$</span>distPlot <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> reactivePlot<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">()</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">{</span>\r\n        dist <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> rnorm<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>input<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">$</span>obs<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n        hist<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>dist<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n    <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">})</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">})</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">}),</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#--------------------------------------------------------------</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">`ui.R`</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> quote<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">({</span>\r\nshinyUI<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>pageWithSidebar<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>\r\n  headerPanel<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Hello Shiny!&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">),</span> \r\n  sidebarPanel<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>sliderInput<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;obs&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> \r\n    <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Number of observations:&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> min <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">0</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> max <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1000</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> value <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">500</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)),</span> \r\n    mainPanel<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>plotOutput<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;distPlot&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">})</span>\r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n</pre></div><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">If you want to simple write out the files to a directory, you can replace <code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">shinyRun</code> with<code style=\"margin:0px 2px;padding:0px 5px;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap\">shinyDeserialize</code>, with something like this:</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><pre style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:15px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);line-height:19px;overflow:auto;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\">\r\n\r\nshinyDeserialize<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span>appdir<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;my_outputdir&quot;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span>\r\n  <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">`server.R`</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">...</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span>\r\n  <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">`ui.R`</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">...</span> \r\n<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span>\r\n</pre></div><p style=\"margin:15px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">Hopefully this will make it easier to share ideas. Enjoy!</p><p style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px!important\">\r\n\r\n-Winston</p><p></p></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
